== Effects ==
* Upon taking damage, Isaac leaves a trail of [[red creep]] that damages enemies until he leaves the room.
** The creep deals 2 damage per tick (6 damage per second) to enemies that walk over it.
* {{dlc|nr}} +5 [[range]].
* {{dlc|r}} +1.5 [[range]].

== Notes ==
* The effects of this item do not stack if multiple copies of the item or its effects are acquired; Isaac only gets the range bonus once.
* {{C|Lazarus}}, or anyone holding {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}, is resurrected with this item upon his first death.
** {{dlc+|a+}} After {{chal|Backasswards}} is beaten, Lazarus will start with Anemic, and Lazarus Risen will have its increased range and creep trail effect permanently active, regardless of whether he possesses the item.{{dlc-}}

